  <!-- 02 The idea (soft band) -->
  <section class="section" id="idea" aria-labelledby="idea-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-mark"><span class="numeral">02</span><p class="eyebrow">A milestone for SVLS LABS</p></div>
      <div class="grid lp-idea">
        <div class="col-6">
          <h2 id="idea-title">Don't Ask AI for a Finished Song. Ask It for <span class="key">the Session</span>.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="col-6 lp-idea__body">
          <p class="lead">CuTTI has reached an important development milestone. It is our production assistant for Logic Pro, built on the Model Context Protocol (MCP), and it now builds a working Logic Pro session from a written brief.</p>
          <p>The idea is straightforward. Instead of asking AI to generate a finished song, ask it to help build the session you actually want to produce from.</p>
          <p>Describe the musical direction. CuTTI interprets that intent and turns it into an editable Logic Pro workflow, with tracks, MIDI, song sections and arrangement structure that you keep shaping.</p>
          <p class="lp-pull">From musical intent to editable production.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

